      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，以戏剧界的顶点作为目标。\r\n即便身处不同的舞台，你和我也还是永远的竞争对手哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc419c4d7c2dd29ef3b50ad47a18f309bb6b810bfe00c73a47b8f8a5637ba352",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
